# Fatal Push: "Destroy target creature if it has mana value 2 or less." No permanent has left the battlefield under
# Bot1's control, so no revolt. On turn 3 Bot1 pushes Bot2's Monastery Mentor (mana value 3): it survives. It pushes
# Painter's Servant (mana value 2): it dies. On turn 5 it pushes a Walking Ballista that Bot2 cast with X = 2 on turn 4:
# a creature on the battlefield has an X of 0, so its mana value is 0 and it dies.

